# Phase 14a V6 (docs/phase14a-brief.md 3.8): Videos > Settings.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-video scripts/shots.sh tests/video/ui_video_settings.script
# "setvideos" -> ui_setvideos_push() (proposed sim_cmd_video.c command;
# once V5's Videos menu lands, reach it with Videos > Settings keys).
# needs: library
# (kept under tests/video, not tests/ui: the gate runs ui/ against build/sim-ui, which has no video commands; move to tests/ui once the Movies list can reach the screen)
wait 4000
setvideos
wait 800
shot start               # Start Playing: Where Left Off / Fit to Screen: On
key SELECT
wait 300
shot from_beginning      # Start Playing: From Beginning
wheel +1
wait 300
key SELECT
wait 300
shot fit_off             # Fit to Screen: Off
key SELECT
wait 300
key MENU
wait 700
shot back
